    <string name="pages_help_1">Here you decide which pages the bike computer shows and which data appears on them. Every riding mode has its own pages.</string>
    <string name="pages_help_2">Tap a page to change the number and arrangement of its fields and the data in each field. The switch hides a page.</string>
